# Adapted from Aurum's chapter aurum-druid/excavation-site (Aurums Night Elf Druid Guide 0.4.37,
# GPL-3.0), as 10-site-de-fouilles.guide was. Same sources: Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex
# (quests, givers, enders: Lost in the Thicket Things ends with Ardin Grassman inside, Heartwoven goes
# to Caitlin), the dungeon step by step from Wowhead Forever's guide and comments (read on
# 2026-11-08), rewritten. Polestar 0.4.2.2's run (GPL-3.0, data/dungeon-runs.json and its `when
# dungeon "Excavation Site: Wetlands"` steps of forever/alliance/06-wetlands): the door at Wetlands
# 48.0,56.5 (players' recordings), Highland Hides (98815, after Young Crocolisk Skins), Horrors in the
# Highland (95646, after Blisters on the Land), Prospector Whelgar's Prehistoric Prism (98824) for
# High Explorer Magellas in Ironforge. Not played in game yet.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's route: the Groupe Alliance module offers it once Seeking
# Caitlin (95737) is handed in to Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor, near the end of
# forever/alliance/06-wetlands (about level 30), whose next stop is the flight to Ironforge: the
# chapter ends with High Explorer Magellas there, and the route's Ironforge steps follow.
# At the switch this chapter takes the id groupe-alliance/10-site-de-fouilles.
#
# Compared with Polestar's run (98815 and 95646 only, at about 28, the hand-ins spread up to
# Hillsbrad): all in one go at the dungeon's level (quests and last boss 31), with Caitlin's own
# two quests (95647, 95809: about 11,000 XP), which Polestar leaves out as 3 levels over at 28.
# Songblade Search and Fallen in the Fen (95772, 95795) only for whoever took Dorin Songblade's quest
# in Lakeshire: Polestar's route does not offer it at that level.
guide groupe-alliance/greffe/site-de-fouilles
title Dungeon · Excavation Site: Wetlands (27-34)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 27-34
zone Wetlands

step Menethil Harbor: dungeon quests
  zone Wetlands
  tip Excavation Site: a 5-player Forever dungeon up the hill in the middle of the Wetlands, levels 26 to 33 in the group finder. Everything inside is elite and the last boss is 31: about 39,000 XP of quests and blue rewards.
  note Keep 6 free quest log slots. Caitlin Grassman is in her house, James Halloran by the north gate.
  accept 95647                                -- Caitlin Grassman
  accept 98815                                -- James Halloran

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  zone Wetlands
  tip On the Green Belt, east of the road, on the way to the dig. He gives it once Blisters on the Land is done, which the route did.
  accept 95646                                -- Rethiel the Greenwarden

step Songblade Search, for whoever carries it
  when onquest 95772
  tip Dorin Songblade's quest, from Lakeshire: his daughter Daewyn is inside.
  accept 95772 optional                       -- Dorin Songblade, Lakeshire

step Excavation Site entrance
  tip From the meeting stone near Thelgen Rock, follow the mountain path up to the portal. A single graveyard serves the area: a wipe means a long walk back.
  note In the log before going in: Lost in the Thicket Things (Caitlin Grassman), Highland Hides (James Halloran), Horrors in the Highland (Rethiel). Share each quest with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share. Talk to Ardin Grassman and Daewyn as soon as you find them inside: their follow-ups start with them.
  goto 48.0,56.5 "Excavation Site" r 25

step Saltspine
  tip Clear around him first. Tendon Rip slows the tank hard and his Dust Storm makes everyone within 10 yards miss: casters stay out of it.
  kill 260322                                 -- Saltspine

step The tall grass and Shadetooth
  tip The most dangerous stretch: Thicket Lurkers leap out of the tall grass, and Matriarchs call more of them at low health. Keep to the narrow path, fight in the open, kill the others before a Matriarch. Shadetooth comes with two Thicket Hunters (dispel Infected Wound): crowd-control one, kill the other, and fight him in the crocodile cove on the left so his fear cannot throw anyone into the grass.
  collect 284845 x4 quest 98815               -- Thicket Raptor Hide: Shadetooth and the Thicket raptors

step Daewyn Songblade
  when onquest 95772
  tip Daewyn stands near the burned dig camp, by the Dragonmaw.
  turnin 95772 optional                       -- Daewyn: Songblade Search, from Dorin in Lakeshire
  accept 95795 optional

step The Highland Horror
  tip The Highland Horror (elite 28) stands right of the Dragonmaw and the burned dig camp; only this one inside drops the rootcore, not the one outside the dungeon.
  collect 270180 quest 95646                  -- Horrible Rootcore: Highland Horror, elite 28

step Relic Guardian
  tip The last boss, level 31, woken by the Archival Panel on its right. Thunderclap slows everyone within 10 yards, and it knocks back and stuns the tank for 5 seconds: rotate stuns and slows, keep healing the tank, kite round the structures if need be. Ardin Grassman waits on the wooden scaffold by its arena.
  turnin 95647                                -- Ardin Grassman, each player talks to him
  accept 95809
  accept 95810 item 270865                    -- Titan Relic, from the Relic Guardian: right-click it

step Rethiel's reward
  zone Wetlands
  tip Back down the path: Rethiel is on the Green Belt.
  turnin 95646                                -- Rethiel the Greenwarden

step Prospector Whelgar
  tip In the small cave of the outdoor dig, west of the road.
  turnin 95810
  accept 98824

step Menethil rewards
  zone Wetlands
  turnin 98815                                -- James Halloran
  turnin 95809                                -- Caitlin Grassman: pick mana potions for casters

step Lakeshire: Dorin Songblade
  when onquest 95795
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Only for whoever took Dorin's quest in Lakeshire: the flight there and back. Otherwise straight on to Ironforge.
  fly "Lakeshire"
  turnin 95795 optional

step Ironforge: High Explorer Magellas
  zone Ironforge
  tip Fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge, as the route does next: Magellas stands in the Hall of Explorers. He says you lack the Titan Relic? Abandon the quest and take it again from Whelgar for a new relic. Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back once this is handed in.
  fly "Ironforge"
  turnin 98824                                -- High Explorer Magellas
